    "Required by Tono to prevent application bypass": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 必需，用于防止应用绕过保护"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requires Remote Diagnostics. Shares aggregate Claude protection and native WeChat trial route counts, including rejected or unknown app attribution, plus fixed exit and bypass verdicts. Official claude.ai/anthropic.com hostnames, ports and byte totals may be included; every other destination is aggregated into an \"other\" bucket carrying only route class, port and byte totals — never the hostname. Raw IPs, process names, paths, content and raw logs stay local.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要先开启远程诊断。共享 Claude 保护与微信原生试用路由的聚合计数（含被拒或未知应用归因）以及固定的出口与绕行判定。可能包含官方 claude.ai/anthropic.com 主机名、端口与字节总量；其他所有目标只归入“其他”桶，仅携带路由类别、端口与字节总量——绝不包含主机名。原始 IP、进程名、路径、内容与原始日志均保留在本地。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
