    "This Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is exactly what Tono reports when support requests a diagnostic snapshot. It carries no hostnames, IP addresses, process names or account tokens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这就是技术支持索取诊断快照时 Tono 会上报的全部内容，其中不含主机名、IP 地址、进程名或账号令牌。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
