      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To work reliably, Tono must run from the Applications folder. Quit Tono, drag it onto Applications in the installer window, then open the installed copy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为确保 Tono 稳定运行，必须从“应用程序”文件夹启动。请退出 Tono，在安装窗口中将它拖到“应用程序”，然后打开已安装的副本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono": {},
    "Tono Account": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 账户"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono Protection": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 保护"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono account suspended": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 账户已被停用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono does not expose the protected route to LAN clients.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 不会把受保护线路开放给局域网客户端。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono keeps Rule mode locked so traffic cannot bypass the protected cloud route.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 锁定规则模式，以防流量绕过受保护的云端线路。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono keeps one local, redacted log file. Support may call it the audit log or the diagnostics log — it is the same file. Credentials and URL queries are removed before anything is written.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 只保留一份本地脱敏日志。技术支持可能称它为审计日志或诊断日志——指的是同一个文件。凭据与 URL 查询参数在写入前已被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono quit unexpectedly on %@ · %@ · build %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 曾于 %1$@ 意外退出 · %2$@ · 构建 %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono requires TUN mode while cloud protection is active.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "云端保护启用期间，Tono 必须使用 TUN 模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono's network helper rejected this copy of Tono, so automatic retries are paused. Choose Repair and reconnect to reinstall the helper, or Restore internet to turn protection off. If repair keeps failing, the Support page has a recovery command.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 的网络助手拒绝了当前这份 Tono，自动重试已暂停。请选择「修复并重新连接」以重新安装助手，或选择「恢复正常网络」以关闭保护。若修复反复失败，「支持与诊断」页面提供了恢复命令。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tono's network helper rejected this copy of Tono, so protection was not released and your traffic stays protected. Choose Restore internet again to repair the helper and release protection. If repair keeps failing, the Support page has a recovery command. %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tono 的网络助手拒绝了当前这份 Tono，因此保护未被解除，你的流量仍受保护。请再次选择「恢复正常网络」以修复助手并解除保护。若修复反复失败，「支持与诊断」页面提供了恢复命令。%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
